WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:06,500
Story. The Talent Show.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,010
Dong Dong has a dream.

3
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:15,140
Can you help me, Grandpa?

4
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:17,710
Sure.

5
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:21,570
What can you do?

6
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:26,090
I can sing.

7
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:29,690
I can play the violin.

8
00:00:29,690 --> 00:00:32,140
Great.

9
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:38,140
I can dance.

10
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:41,890
I can ride a bike.

11
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:44,810
At the school talent show.

12
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:48,250
Hello, everyone.

13
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:51,410
My sister can dance.

14
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:55,370
My grandma can play the violin.

15
00:00:55,370 --> 00:00:58,700
My grandpa can sing.

16
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:03,330
I can ride a bike.

17
00:01:03,330 --> 00:01:07,020
We win!

18
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:12,300
What can Dong Dong's family do in his dream?
